msgid ""
"---\n"
"title: How to use PGroonga with Railway\n"
"---"
msgstr ""
"---\n"
"title: RailwayでPGroongaを使う方法\n"
"---"

msgid "# How to use PGroonga with Railway"
msgstr "# RailwayでPGroongaを使う方法"

msgid ""
"This guide explains how to use the [Railway template](https://railway.com/"
"deploy/pgroonga).\n"
"The Railway’s scalable infrastructure makes it easy to deploy PGroonga with "
"persistent storage and one-click setup."
msgstr ""
"このガイドでは[Railwayテンプレート](https://railway.com/deploy/pgroonga)の使"
"い方を説明します。Railwayのスケーラブルなインフラを使えば、永続ストレージ付き"
"のPGroongaをワンクリックで簡単にデプロイできます。"

msgid "## Implementation Details"
msgstr "## 使い方の詳細"

msgid "### Setup Configuration"
msgstr "### セットアップ方法"

msgid ""
"This template provides PostgreSQL with the PGroonga extension pre-installed. "
"A TCP proxy is configured to allow access to the database from anywhere, "
"enabling external connections to the PGroonga database."
msgstr ""
"このテンプレートはPGroongaがインストール済みのPostgreSQLを提供します。どこか"
"らでもデータベースにアクセスできるようにTCPプロキシが設定されているため、外部"
"からPGroongaデータベースに接続できます。"

msgid ""
"**Security note**:\n"
"The TCP proxy makes your database reachable from the public internet.\n"
"Please take the following precautions before using this template for "
"production workloads:"
msgstr ""
"**セキュリティに関する注意**:\n"
"TCPプロキシを使うと、データベースはどこからでもアクセス可能になります。\n"
"このテンプレートを本番環境で使う前に、次の設定をしてください。"

msgid ""
"* When connecting from another service in the same Railway project, use "
"Railway's [private networking](https://docs.railway.com/guides/private-"
"networking) instead of the public TCP proxy.\n"
"* If you do not need external access, remove the TCP proxy from the service "
"settings in the Railway dashboard."
msgstr ""
"* 同じRailwayプロジェクト内の別のサービスから接続する場合は、パブリックなTCP"
"プロキシではなくRailwayの[プライベートネットワーク](https://docs.railway.com/"
"guides/private-networking)を使ってください。\n"
"* 外部からのアクセスが不要な場合は、Railwayのダッシュボードのサービス設定から"
"TCPプロキシを削除してください。"

msgid ""
"Please configure the following environment variables according to your "
"environment:"
msgstr "環境に合わせて次の環境変数を設定してください。"

msgid ""
"* POSTGRES_USER\n"
"* POSTGRES_PASSWORD\n"
"* POSTGRES_DB"
msgstr ""

msgid "### Database Connection"
msgstr "### データベースに接続"

msgid ""
"Use the DATABASE_URL variable from your Railway service to connect to the "
"PGroonga database."
msgstr ""
"RailwayサービスのDATABASE_URL変数を使ってPGroongaが使えるデータベースに接続し"
"ます。"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"$ psql $DATABASE_URL\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Or, if you want to reference it from another Railway service's variable, you "
"can use it as the [reference variables](https://docs.railway.com/"
"variables#referencing-another-services-variable-example):"
msgstr ""
"別のRailwayサービスから参照したい場合は、[Reference variables](https://docs."
"railway.com/variables#referencing-another-services-variable-example)として使"
"えます。"

msgid "{% raw %}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"```\n"
"${{PGroonga.DATABASE_URL}}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

msgid "{% endraw %}"
msgstr ""

msgid "### How To Use"
msgstr "### 使い方"

msgid "Once connected, enable the PGroonga extension using the following SQL:"
msgstr "接続したら次のSQLでPGroongaを有効にします。"

msgid ""
"```sql\n"
"CREATE EXTENSION pgroonga;\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

msgid "#### Create a full-text search index"
msgstr "#### 全文検索インデックスの作成"

msgid ""
"Create a table with a **`text`** column that you want to enable full-text "
"search on."
msgstr "全文検索対象の**`text`**型のカラムを持つテーブルを作成します。"

msgid ""
"```sql\n"
"CREATE TABLE memos (\n"
"  id integer,\n"
"  content text\n"
");\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

msgid "Create a full-text search index with PGroonga on the target column."
msgstr "対象のカラムにPGroongaで全文検索インデックスを作成します。"

msgid ""
"```sql\n"
"CREATE INDEX pgroonga_content_index ON memos USING pgroonga (content);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

msgid "(Optional) Insert some sample data."
msgstr "（オプション）サンプルデータを登録します。"

msgid ""
"```sql\n"
"INSERT INTO memos VALUES (1, 'PostgreSQL is a relational database management "
"system.');\n"
"INSERT INTO memos VALUES (2, 'Groonga is a fast full-text search engine that "
"supports all languages.');\n"
"INSERT INTO memos VALUES (3, 'PGroonga is a PostgreSQL extension that uses "
"Groonga as index.');\n"
"INSERT INTO memos VALUES (4, 'There is groonga command.');\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

msgid "Run a full-text search query."
msgstr "全文検索クエリーを実行します。"

msgid ""
"```sql\n"
"SELECT * FROM memos WHERE content &@~ 'groonga';\n"
"--  id |                                content\n"
"-- ----"
"+------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"--   2 | Groonga is a fast full-text search engine that supports all "
"languages.\n"
"--   3 | PGroonga is a PostgreSQL extension that uses Groonga as index.\n"
"--   4 | There is groonga command.\n"
"-- (3 rows)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Now your setup is complete! You can start running full-text searches "
"instantly."
msgstr "これでセットアップは完了です！すぐに全文検索を使えます。"
